  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P8_took_place_on_or_within">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property describes the location of an instance of E4 Period with respect to an instance of E19 Physical Object.
This property is a shortcut of the more fully developed path from E4 Period through P7 took place at, E53 Place, P156i is occupied by E18 Physical Thing.
It describes a period that can be located with respect to the space defined by an E19 Physical Object such as a ship or a building. The precise geographical location of the object during the period in question may be unknown or unimportant.
For example, the French and German armistice of 22-nd June 1940 was signed in the same railway carriage as the armistice of 11-th November 1918.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E4_Period"/>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P8i_witnessed"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">发生的所在对象是</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pt">ocorreu em ou dentro</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">a eu lieu à</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">fand statt auf oder innerhalb von</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="el">έλαβε χώρα σε ή εντός</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ru">имeл мeсто на или в</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">took place on or within</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
