    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E31_Document"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property describes the CRM Entities documented as instances of E31 Document.
Documents may describe any conceivable entity, hence the link to the highest-level entity in the CIDOC CRM class hierarchy. This property is intended for cases where a reference is regarded as making a proposition about reality. This may be of a documentary character, in the scholarly or scientific sense, or a more general statement.</rdfs:comment>
