  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P197_covered_parts_of">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">covered parts of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">a couvert des parties de</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ru">частично покрывал</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property associates an instance of E93 Presence with an instance of E53 Place that geometrically overlaps with the spatial projection of the respective instance of E93 Presence. A use case of this property is to state through which places an object or an instance of E21 Person has or was moved within a given time-span. It may also be used to describe a partial or complete, temporary or permanent extension of the spatial extent of some realm into a neighbouring region during a known time-span. It may also be used to describe a partial or complete, temporary or permanent extension of the spatial extent of some realm into a neighbouring region during a known time-span.
This property is a shortcut of the more fully developed path from E93 Presence through P161 has spatial projection, E53 Place, P121 overlaps with, to E53 Place.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E93_Presence"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P197i_was_partially_covered_by"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E53_Place"/>
  </rdf:Description>
