  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P5_consists_of">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="pt">consiste de</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="fr">comprend</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="ru">состоит из</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">包括</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">consists of</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="de">besteht aus</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="el">αποτελείται από</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property describes the decomposition of an instance of E3 Condition State into discrete, subsidiary states.
It is assumed that the sub-states into which the condition state is analysed form a logical whole - although the entire story may not be completely known – and that the sub-states are in fact constitutive of the general condition state. For example, a general condition state of “in ruins” may be decomposed into the individual stages of decay.
This property is transitive and asymmetric.</rdfs:comment>
    <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P5i_forms_part_of"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E3_Condition_State"/>
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E3_Condition_State"/>
  </rdf:Description>
